.TH YED-bookmarks 7 "YED Plugin Manuals" "" "YED Plugin Manuals"
.SH NAME
bookmarks \- bookmark lines of code to return to later
.SH CONFIGURATION
.SS bookmark-character "                       " [ ▓ ]
the character displayed in the gutter to indicate a bookmark

.SS bookmark-use-line-numbers "                " [ (0) / 1 ]
enable or disable line numbers in the gutter

.SS bookmark-color "                           " [ &blue ]
the color used for the bookmark indicator in the gutter

.SS bookmark-path-color "                      " [ &green ]
the color used for file paths in the bookmarks list buffer

.SS bookmark-row-color "                       " [ &purple ]
the color used for row numbers in the bookmarks list buffer

.SS bookmark-line-color "                      " [ &gray ]
the color used for line contents in the bookmarks list buffer

.SS bookmark-update-period "                   " [ 5 ]
how often (in seconds) the bookmarks list buffer refreshes

.SS bookmarks-file "                           " [ unset ]
path (relative to cwd) to the file used for persisting bookmarks

.SS bookmark-highlight-line "                  " [ (0) / 1 ]
enable or disable highlighting the entire bookmarked line

.SS bookmark-highlight-line-color "            " [ &blue swap ]
the color used for highlighting bookmarked lines

.SS line-number-scomp "                        " [ code-comment ]
style component used for line numbers

.SH COMMANDS
.SS set-bookmark(row)
set a new bookmark at the given row
.SS remove-bookmark(row)
remove the bookmark at the given row
.SS set-bookmark-on-line
set a new bookmark at the current cursor line
.SS remove-bookmark-on-line
remove the bookmark at the current cursor line
.SS toggle-bookmark-on-line
toggle a bookmark at the current cursor line
.SS remove-all-bookmarks-in-buffer
remove all bookmarks in the current buffer
.SS remove-all-bookmarks
remove all bookmarks across all buffers
.SS goto-next-bookmark
move the cursor to the next bookmark across all buffers
.SS goto-prev-bookmark
move the cursor to the previous bookmark across all buffers
.SS goto-next-bookmark-in-buffer
move the cursor to the next bookmark in the current buffer
.SS goto-prev-bookmark-in-buffer
move the cursor to the previous bookmark in the current buffer
.SS bookmarks
open the *bookmarks-list special buffer
.SH BUFFERS
.SS *bookmarks-list -- a read-only buffer listing all bookmarks, press Enter to jump to a bookmark
.SH NOTES
.SS Bookmarks pointing past the end of a file are automatically removed when the file is loaded.
.SH VERSION
0.0.1
.SH KEYWORDS
bookmarks, line_numbers
